is a short, gorgeous puzzle game built in Unreal Engine 4. Each “level” contains one scenario that you are supposed to reorganize in order to play out an entire scene. Every scenario is unique, from settings to characters to lighting to sound... and it's intriguing to see each of them play out and unlock the next little “sandbox”.
Cleary every one of the puzzles was crafted with much care, attention to detail and competence. It's interesting how some levels are more “realistic” (i.e. tell “real life” stories) and some are completely otherworldly! The amount of creativity funneled into this, as a whole, is a joy to behold.
